Project medical_procurement_bid_optimizer {
  database_type: 'PostgreSQL'
  Note: '''
    Current schema from 23 concrete application models, audited 2026-09-15.
    Django migrations are the executable source.
    Built-in Django and User M2M tables are omitted.
    Defaults and on_delete policies in notes describe Django behavior, not SQL server defaults/actions.
